    "detailed_description": "Play with 4-8 players online, get points for every track you win, and be the next champion!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe recommend playing with friends online using voice chat.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo win the championship, receive points in every track based on race position.<br />\r\nThere are 9 different tracks, with loops and spikes that you need to avoid.<br />\r\nDrop bombs typing &quot;B&quot; so you can blow enemies!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nReach the end of the track and wait for the others while playing a &quot;capture the flag&quot; game and collect extra points!!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures<br />\r\nCustomization: Pick your racer",
    "about_the_game": "Play with 4-8 players online, get points for every track you win, and be the next champion!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe recommend playing with friends online using voice chat.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo win the championship, receive points in every track based on race position.<br />\r\nThere are 9 different tracks, with loops and spikes that you need to avoid.<br />\r\nDrop bombs typing &quot;B&quot; so you can blow enemies!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nReach the end of the track and wait for the others while playing a &quot;capture the flag&quot; game and collect extra points!!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures<br />\r\nCustomization: Pick your racer",
    "short_description": "Crash &amp; Dash is a multplayer wild animal race game with up to 8 players online! The tracks are brutal and you will have to master your racing skills, while leaving bombs for your enemies! Press B to leave a bomb. Press left-click to accelerate. Do nothing to rotate. Have fun!",
